title: Roberta_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Roberta = "">>
<<setPhase Roberta>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Roberta == "begin">>
<<jump Roberta_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Roberta == "comeback">>
<<jump Robreta_Comeback01>>
<<else>>
Roberta: Why are you here?? You didnt even give me dialogue!!
<<endif>>
===
title: Roberta_Begin01
---
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "npc">>
Roberta: SHHH!!! Are you trying to give away my hiding spot??
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "pc">>
You: Oh, sorry.
You: What are you hiding from?
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "npc">>
Roberta: Daniel wants my Maxwell.
Roberta: But he can't have it cause its MINE!!!!
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "pc">>
You: ...can I have it?
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "npc">>
Roberta: Oh yeah sure! I don't see why not.
<<collectMaxwell GameController>>
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "pc">>
You: Thanks!
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Roberta "comeback">>
===
title: Robreta_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "npc">>
Roberta: Don't go giving that Maxwell to Daniel now!
<<camMove Roberta_CamRig "return">>
===
